# /// script
# requires-python = ">=3.12"
# dependencies = ["playwright==1.63.0", "platformdirs==4.12.2", "cmake==4.4.3", "ninja==1.13.2", "libclang==18.1.1", "psutil==7.2.2", "numpy==2.3.5", "matplotlib==3.10.8", "pillow==12.3.0", "onnx==1.19.1", "protobuf==6.32.1", "ml-dtypes==0.5.1"]
# ///
"""Standalone strict-FP32 OFF attribution diagnostic; source-only distribution.

Run: uv run --script voicevox_core_benchmark.py --output off-attribution-report
Offline: --help, --dry-run, --self-test, --extract-helpers DIRECTORY.
Self-tests compile two tiny native C unit harnesses; no CORE builds or inference.
Build without browser inference: --prepare-only. Check public files with
--validate-report DIRECTORY: canonical JSON and exactly regenerated HTML.

Linux x86-64, a C/C++ compiler and Chromium system libraries are required.
Pinned Rust 1.96.0 / Emscripten 4.0.8 / Playwright 1.63.0 install into private caches.
Chromium major must be 153. This script does not install system packages.
Six CORE links: four unchanged affine-v7 production/legacy-gate builds plus two
separate count-only siblings. Download, source, IR and native receipts are checked.

Nine fresh normal-tiering Chrome 153 OFF production-profile sessions cover
original, unchanged rebuilt and affine controls in three cyclic process orders.
Each session has two warmups, three retained syntheses and one raw exactness call:
54 production inferences, 27 retained syntheses. Two separate untimed counter
sessions have two warmups plus two exactness calls each: eight more inferences.
Strict FP32, fixture 962, XNN 2 / ORT 1, seed 1729. Diagnostic durations are not an
end-to-end speed benchmark and do not support optimization promotion.

Only validated aggregate summary.json and standalone report.html are public.
Raw profile events, node names, tensor values, audio, models, arbitrary logs and
paths are excluded. No uploads or GitHub writes occur. Build logs, binaries and
models remain private. Cold preparation may need several GB and up to four hours.
Before each of six link stages, at least 4 GiB free cache space is required;
other build stages require 1 GiB. Failure preserves existing private receipts.
"""
